{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07589","headline":"过河滨和文学张志尹 · 萧颖士","name":"过河滨和文学张志尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隆古日以远，举世丧其淳。\n慷慨怀黄虞，化理何由臻。\n步出城西门，裴回见河滨。\n当其侧陋时，河水清且潾。\n沧桑一以变，莽然翳荆榛。\n至化无苦窳，宇宙将陶甄。\n太息感悲泉，人往迹未湮。\n瑟瑟寒原暮，冷风吹衣巾。\n顾我譾劣质，希圣杳无因。\n且尽登临意，斗酒欢相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}